# C3: the std submodules mlmf-bnb may name. Grows one commit at a time,
# each entry landing beside the code that forced it.
#
# `borrow` -- `std::borrow::Cow`, the return type of TensorContainer::tensor_bytes
#   as mlmf-core spells it, carried through to `BnbLayerBytes`.
# `error`  -- `impl std::error::Error for BnbError`.
# `fmt`    -- `impl std::fmt::Display for BnbError`.
borrow
error
fmt
